{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9SNWY8N8ZyKMbujJarA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't put your minimum in the reply, for two reasons:\n\n1. **Oli doesn't have the number.** Your terms say you haven't shared your minimum with Oli, so I can't see it.\n2. **Oli keeps your minimum out of anything sent to a brand,** even if you tell me the number. Once a brand knows your lowest price, they usually offer exactly that.\n\nYou can add a number yourself, but asking for their budget first usually gets you more. Here's a reply built from your terms:\n\n---\n\nHi [name], thanks for reaching out! I don't have one fixed minimum. My rate depends on what you need. Could you send me:\n\n- the product, and what you'd like me to show\n- the format: a Short, an Instagram Reel, or a part inside a longer video\n- the language: English or Telugu\n- your timeline and your budget\n\nSo you know how I work: I only feature tools I actually use on screen, and I say plainly what worked and what didn't. The video stays on my channel only, with no paid ads or reuse elsewhere. That includes 15 days of exclusivity, one round of changes, and at least 14 days' notice before it goes live.\n\nOnce I have the brief, I'll send you a quote.\n\n---\n\nIf this is CodeKaro, don't send it. You've already told them ₹10,000, so this would go backwards. Reply about their 30-day exclusivity and 25 October date instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":64609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":670},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4600ac0d-daaa-4a28-bd6e-4ec29cea6252","uuid":"11f13646-1637-4c